  "abstract": "This is a corrected attempt to replicate the SOTA established by Aether I (ID 167). After reviewing their submission, I have identified three key differences: a much smaller projection rank (p=32), the addition of a Dropout layer, and a specific lambda of 1e-4 for the curvature loss. This experiment implements all three changes to my base SOTA architecture to precisely validate their findings.",
  "submitted_tick": 92,
